# Design system

- `src/design/tokens/` + `createTheme` are the source for colors, spacing, radii, and typography.
- Consume themes with `useTheme()`; support light and dark appearance.
- In features use design primitives: `Text`, `Button`, `Input`, `Amount`, `Card`, `Sheet`, `Icon`, `EmptyState`, `ErrorState`, `Skeleton`.
- Prefer token-driven inline styles or small colocated style objects — never raw hex / magic spacing in feature UI (seed category colors are allowed in `src/db/seed.ts`).
- Never set `lineHeight` anywhere (theme tokens, StyleSheet, inline styles, or Text props). Let the platform default line height stand.
- Preserve dynamic text, touch targets (`theme.touchTarget`), roles, and useful accessibility labels.
- Motion must respect reduce-motion via `ThemeProvider` / motion tokens.
- User-facing copy lives in `src/i18n/locales/` (`en.ts` / `ar.ts`). English and Arabic are supported; switching language that flips layout direction restarts the app for correct RTL/LTR.
